"The Artonans brought the System to Earth in the early 1960s, about 70 years ago."
"The first superhumans were made when the System arrived."
"Without the Artonans, Earth might not have the internet or cell phones."
"For first contact the Artonans camped in the Ténéré in the Sahara."
"They invited world leaders to teleport in for wevvi and a talk about their species' future."
"Artonan children still ask whether humans come from Anesidora Earth or Sahara Earth."
